  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns the vector position of the object's center of mass in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Region" target="_blank">region coordinates</a>.</p>
  <p>If called from a child prim, the child's center of mass is returned instead (but still in region coordinates).</p>
</p>
    </div>

